{"id":"largo","lemma":"largo","pos":"adj","rank":486,"glosses":["long (having much distance from one terminating point to another)","long, lengthy, extended, prolonged, protracted, (having great duration)","long, long-running (seemingly lasting a lot of time)"],"ipa":"/ˈlaɾɡo/","forms":{"feminine":"larga","masculinePlural":"largos","femininePlural":"largas"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/a/af/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Rodelar-largo.wav","examples":[{"text":"Mi pelo es largo.","en":"My hair is long.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/456404","words":[{"g":"my"},{"g":"hair"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},null]},{"text":"Tu pelo está demasiado largo.","en":"Your hair is too long.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/39709","words":[{"g":"your"},{"g":"hair"},{"g":"to be","l":"estar"},{"g":"too much"},null]},{"text":"Los días se están haciendo más largos.","en":"Days are getting longer.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/71105","words":[{"g":"the / them"},{"g":"day","l":"día"},{"g":"oneself"},{"g":"to be","l":"estar"},{"g":"to do","l":"hacer"},{"g":"more"},null]},{"text":"¿Qué tan largo es ese puente?","en":"How long is that bridge?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/459497","words":[{"g":"what"},{"g":"so, as"},null,{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"that"},{"g":"bridge"}]},{"text":"Tus brazos son más largos que los míos.","en":"Your arms are longer than mine.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/354691","words":[{"g":"your"},{"g":"arm","l":"brazo"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"more"},null,{"g":"that"},null,null],"phrases":[[6,8,"My lot"]]}]}